  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Social Fund for Development Programme to Improve Access to Basic Social Services in Yemen. is a component of Social Fund for Development Programme to Improve Access to Basic Social Services in Yemen. reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;62,511,452. It works in the following sector(s): Social Protection, Education facilities and training, Health policy and administrative management, Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Democratic participation and civil society, Women&apos;s rights organisations and movements, and government institutions, Basic drinking water supply and basic sanitation, Agricultural development.</narrative>
